---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Witchly — Scaling a free game-server platform to 10,000 users | Tushar A."
  description="How Tushar built Witchly.host: 10,000+ users on bare-metal Hetzner, €100/mo, mitigated 50 Gbps L7 DDoS in <20 minutes via three-tier plane separation."
  pageType="article"
  keywords="Witchly, game server hosting, free hosting, Hetzner bare-metal, Docker, Pterodactyl, DDoS mitigation, three-tier architecture, Tushar A."
>
  <Nav />

  <main class="container case">
    <a href="/" class="back-link">← Back to home</a>

    <article class="tile case-head reveal">
      <p class="section-eyebrow">/case-study</p>
      <h1 class="case-title">Witchly</h1>
      <p class="case-deck">
        A free game-server hosting platform on bare-metal Hetzner. 10,000+ users,
        bootstrapped, €100/mo infra. Plus the time a 50 Gbps L7 DDoS hit and we
        recovered in under 20 minutes with zero data loss.
      </p>
      <div class="case-meta">
        <span>August 2021 — Present</span>
        <span class="dot">·</span>
        <span>Founder & Lead Systems Engineer</span>
        <span class="dot">·</span>
        <a href="https://witchly.host" target="_blank" rel="noopener">witchly.host →</a>
      </div>
    </article>

    <section class="case-stats reveal" aria-label="Witchly stats">
      <div class="case-stats-row">
        <div class="case-stat">
          <span class="case-stat-value">10,000+</span>
          <span class="case-stat-label">Registered users</span>
        </div>
        <div class="case-stat-divider" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="case-stat">
          <span class="case-stat-value good">50 Gbps+</span>
          <span class="case-stat-label">DDoS mitigated</span>
        </div>
        <div class="case-stat-divider" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="case-stat">
          <span class="case-stat-value">€100/mo</span>
          <span class="case-stat-label">Infra cost</span>
        </div>
        <div class="case-stat-divider" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="case-stat">
          <span class="case-stat-value">$3K+/mo</span>
          <span class="case-stat-label">Equiv. AWS cost</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <article class="tile case-intro reveal">
      <p>
        Game-server hosting sits in an awkward gap. Free platforms like Aternos and
        Minehut are severely resource-constrained and unreliable under load. Commercial
        hosts charge $15–30 per server per month, pricing out hobbyists and small
        communities entirely. Nobody was offering production-grade, low-latency
        infrastructure at zero cost.
      </p>
      <p>
        Witchly was built to close that gap — and to do it on zero external funding.
        Every architectural decision maximises raw compute per euro so the free tier
        is economically viable long-term. The full case study below walks through the
        stack, the DDoS incident, and the cost economics.
        <strong>The PDF renders inline — you can also <a href="/Case-Study/Witchly-scaling.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">download it directly</a>.</strong>
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="tile case-pdf reveal" aria-label="Witchly case study PDF">
      <object
        data="/Case-Study/Witchly-scaling.pdf"
        type="application/pdf"
        class="pdf-frame"
        aria-label="Witchly case study"
      >
        <div class="pdf-fallback">
          <p>
            Your browser can't display the PDF inline.
            <a href="/Case-Study/Witchly-scaling.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
              Download the case study →
            </a>
          </p>
        </div>
      </object>
    </article>

    <section class="case-stack-wrap reveal">
      <h2 class="section-h">Stack at a glance</h2>
      <div class="bento stack-grid">
        <div class="tile stack-item span-4 row-1">
          <p class="stack-h">Hardware</p>
          <p class="stack-b">Hetzner bare-metal — Intel i9-9900K, 128 GB RAM, 2 TB NVMe. Ubuntu 20.04, in Germany and Finland.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="tile stack-item span-4 row-1">
          <p class="stack-h">Orchestration</p>
          <p class="stack-b">Docker + Pterodactyl. Tenant isolation enforced at the kernel via cgroup CPU pinning and hard RAM limits.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="tile stack-item span-4 row-1">
          <p class="stack-h">Architecture</p>
          <p class="stack-b">Three independently-scalable planes: frontend, control plane, data plane. Game UDP/TCP bypasses the control plane entirely.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="tile stack-item span-4 row-1">
          <p class="stack-h">Custom dashboard</p>
          <p class="stack-b">Built from scratch — server provisioning, native Stripe billing, real-time per-server CPU/RAM/storage, internal REST APIs.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="tile stack-item span-4 row-1">
          <p class="stack-h">DDoS defence</p>
          <p class="stack-b">Layered: Cloudflare WAF at the edge, AS-level filtering at the CDN, host-level UFW + Fail2Ban with default-deny.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="tile stack-item span-4 row-1">
          <p class="stack-h">Cost</p>
          <p class="stack-b">€100/mo for the full cluster vs $3,000+/mo for equivalent EC2 + Shield Advanced. The delta makes the free tier viable.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <article class="tile case-cta reveal">
      <h2>Want to chat about scaling, hosting, or DDoS engineering?</h2>
      <div class="case-cta-row">
        <a href="/#contact" class="btn btn-primary">Get in touch</a>
        <a href="/Case-Study/Witchly-scaling.pdf" class="btn btn-outline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          Download PDF
        </a>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .case {
    padding-top: 100px;
    padding-bottom: 40px;
    max-width: 1100px;
  }

  .back-link {
    display: inline-block;
    color: var(--muted-3);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    transition: color 0.2s var(--ease);
  }

  .back-link:hover {
    color: var(--primary-soft);
  }

  .case-head {
    padding: clamp(28px, 4vw, 44px);
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 20% 20%, rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.10), transparent 50%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 80% 80%, rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.08), transparent 50%),
      var(--tile-bg);
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }

  .case-title {
    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5vw, 4rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -2px;
    line-height: 1;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff 0%, var(--accent) 100%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    margin: 8px 0 14px;
  }

  .case-deck {
    color: var(--text);
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.25rem);
    line-height: 1.55;
    max-width: 760px;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }

  .case-meta {
    color: var(--muted-3);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .case-meta .dot {
    opacity: 0.5;
  }

  .case-meta a {
    color: var(--primary-soft);
    transition: color 0.2s var(--ease);
  }

  .case-meta a:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  /* Stats — same pattern as home StatsStrip */
  .case-stats {
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }

  .case-stats-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 16px;
    padding: 28px clamp(20px, 3vw, 36px);
    background: var(--tile-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--tile-border);
    border-radius: var(--tile-radius);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
  }

  .case-stat {
    flex: 1;
    text-align: center;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .case-stat-value {
    display: block;
    font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 2.6vw, 1.95rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -1.2px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-feature-settings: 'tnum';
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary-soft), var(--accent));
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  }

  .case-stat-value.good {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--good-soft), var(--good));
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  }

  .case-stat-label {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 8px;
    color: var(--muted-3);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .case-stat-divider {
    width: 1px;
    height: 40px;
    background: var(--border);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .case-stats-row {
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 24px 16px;
      padding: 24px 16px;
    }
    .case-stat {
      flex: 0 1 calc(50% - 16px);
    }
    .case-stat-divider { display: none; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 380px) {
    .case-stat {
      flex: 0 1 100%;
    }
  }

  .case-intro {
    padding: clamp(24px, 3vw, 32px);
    margin-bottom: 18px;
    max-width: none;
  }

  .case-intro p {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .case-intro p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .case-intro strong {
    color: var(--text);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .case-intro a {
    color: var(--primary-soft);
    border-bottom: 1px dashed currentColor;
  }

  .case-intro a:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .case-pdf {
    padding: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .pdf-frame {
    width: 100%;
    height: 80vh;
    min-height: 560px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: #1a1a22;
    display: block;
  }

  .pdf-fallback {
    padding: 60px 30px;
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .pdf-fallback a {
    color: var(--primary-soft);
  }

  .case-stack-wrap {
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .section-h {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-strong);
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .stack-h {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }

  .stack-b {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .case-cta {
    text-align: center;
    padding: clamp(32px, 5vw, 48px);
    background:
      linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.08), rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.06)),
      var(--tile-bg);
  }

  .case-cta h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 2.2vw, 1.6rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-strong);
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }

  .case-cta-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 12px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
</style>
